{"hymn":"S457","parent":"E590","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Desde vasos terrenales","subtitle":"Experiencia de Cristo—Expresarlo a Él","syl":{"n1":["Des","i"],"n2":["de","t"],"n3":["va","i"],"n4":["sos","t"],"n5":["te","i"],"n7":["rre","m"],"n8":["na","m"],"n9":["les","t"],"n10":["Res","i"],"n11":["plan","m"],"n12":["de","m"],"n13":["ces","t"],"n14":"sin","n16":["ce","i"],"n17":["sar,","t"],"n18":["Al","i"],"n19":["can","m"],"n20":["zan","m"],"n21":["do","t"],"n22":"a","n24":"las","n25":["gen","i"],"n26":["tes:","t"],"n27":["¡Cris","i"],"n28":["to‿y","t"],"n29":"Su","n31":["ra","i"],"n32":["dian","m"],"n33":["te","t"],"n34":"faz!"},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Cristo es la luz del cielo","Que nos da Su resplandor;","Luz de vida en las sombras,","Pues Su‿Espíritu nos dio."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Descendió del cielo y trajo","Tal tesoro‿el mismo Dios;","¡Qué profundo pensamiento!","¡Oh, qué dulce‿y tierno‿amor!"]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Somos barro, nada‿hermoso,","Mas nuestro tesoro es","Reluciente y glorioso,","Celestial, eterno y fiel."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Vasos frágiles y‿endebles,","Mas llevando‿en nuestro ser","Sus riquezas insondables;","¡Don de Dios, Su Hijo fiel!"]}]}